{#
  templates/excluded.html.j2
  Project : Campaign Donations
  Date    : 2026-10-29
  Purpose : Records left out of the totals (issue #3): implausible individual
            gifts and committees reported as individuals, each with its FEC
            filing. The contributor's name is not shown: these records are
            errors, so the name next to the amount is most likely wrong.
  Change log:
    2026-10-29  0.1.0  Initial version.
#}
{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% block title %}Records left out{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
      <h1>Records left out</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        These itemized receipts are in the candidates' FEC reports but are left out of every
        total and donor page here, because they cannot be right as filed.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Above the plausible limit for one person:</strong> a single gift (or refund)
          over {{ max_gift | usd }} reported as coming from an individual other than the
          candidate. The legal limit is a few thousand dollars per election, so these are
          almost always typing errors or committees entered as people.</li>
        <li><strong>A committee reported as an individual:</strong> money from a committee,
          such as a joint fundraising committee, marked as an individual's gift.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>The contributor's name is not shown, because the name next to an impossible amount is
        likely to be wrong. Each record links to the page of the filing it came from.</p>
{% if rows %}
      <section>
        <table>
          <caption>{{ rows | length }} records, largest first</caption>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Cycle</th><th scope="col">Candidate</th><th scope="col">Date</th><th scope="col" class="num">Amount</th><th scope="col">Why left out</th><th scope="col">Source</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
{% for e in rows %}
            <tr>
              <td>{{ e.cycle - 1 }}&ndash;{{ e.cycle }}</td>
              <td><a href="{{ root }}{{ e.candidate.path }}">{{ e.candidate.name }}</a></td>
              <td>{{ e.date or "" }}</td>
              <td class="num">{{ e.amount | usd }}</td>
              <td>{{ e.reason }}</td>
              <td>{% if e.source_url %}<a href="{{ e.source_url }}">filing</a>{% endif %}</td>
            </tr>
{% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </section>
{% else %}
      <p>No records are left out in this build.</p>
{% endif %}
{% endblock %}
